        <hr>
        <div class="usage-notes">
        <h3>Usage Notes</h3>
        <ul class="notes-list">
        <li>
        <strong>Default Unit</strong>: When no unit is specified, <code>px</code> is used
        </li>
        <li>
        <strong>Viewport Units</strong>: Only available for sizing and font-size properties
        </li>
        <li>
        <strong>Auto Support</strong>: Available for sizing and positioning properties where applicable
        </li>
        <li>
        <strong>Shorthand Support</strong>: Available for padding, margin, border-width, and border-radius
        </li>
        <li>
        <strong>Responsive</strong>: All properties support responsive prefixes (<code>uk-sm-</code>, <code>uk-md-</code>, <code>uk-lg-</code>, <code>uk-xl-</code>, <code>uk-xxl-</code>)
        </li>
        <li>
        <strong>Color Format</strong>: Use 3-digit (<code>f00</code>) or 6-digit (<code>ff0000</code>) hex without <code>#</code>
        </li>
        <li>
        <strong>Opacity</strong>: Add <code>-50</code> suffix for 50% opacity on color properties
        </li>
        </ul>
